[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Goodbye and Good Luck]
[00:01.18]Where is Captain Alison going and how? | 艾莉森船长要去哪里，怎么去？
[00:15.17]Our neighbour, Captain Charles Alison, will sail from Portsmouth tomorrow. | 我们的邻居，查尔斯·艾莉森船长，明天将从朴茨茅斯启航。
[00:23.10]We'll meet him at the harbour early in the morning. | 我们明天一早将在港口与他会合。
[00:27.08]He will be in his small boat, Topsail. | 他将乘坐他的小船“上帆号”。
[00:31.13]Topsail is a famous little boat. | “上帆号”是一艘著名的小船。
[00:34.56]It has sailed across the Atlantic many times. | 它已经多次横渡大西洋。
[00:39.09]Captain Alison will set out at eight o'clock, | 艾莉森船长将在八点钟出发，
[00:42.84]so we'll have plenty of time. | 所以我们有充足的时间。
[00:45.46]We'll see his boat and then we'll say goodbye to him. | 我们将去看他的船，然后向他告别。
[00:49.87]He will be away for two months. | 他将离开两个月。
[00:52.80]We are very proud of him. | 我们为他感到非常自豪。
[00:55.50]He will take part in an important race across the Atlantic. | 他将参加一场重要的横渡大西洋的比赛。